            <ArticleTitle>Polypharmacy treatment approaches to the psychiatric and somatic comorbidities found in patients with chronic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S56-63</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review outlines the following: psychiatric and somatic comorbidities associated with chronic pain and their relationship to polypharmacy treatment, indications for polypharmacy in chronic pain, criteria for rational polypharmacy, basic principles of polypharmacy for pain-associated comorbidity, and, based on the above, psychopharmacologic polypharmacy treatment approaches to these chronic pain-associated comorbidities.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
